From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 13:28:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] drm/apple-g5p: arm firmware self-park after pinned bring-up

Keep the proven pinned record through ALIVE and control completion. Arm
the idle policy only on a complete live epoch, with policy+4 published
before ctrl+0x20. Refused epochs remain pinned. The coefficient block is
Apple's observed record; its role in avoiding pstate zero is inferred,
not independently isolated. Never disarm an armed live epoch.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
