+ *   "pin 0"              the firmware governor owns the target (the fixed policy);
+ *   "pin N"              N in 100..400 by 100: ctrl+0x1038/0x1040 = N, the kext's override
+ *                        input, copied by the governor into policy+0x68c/0x6f4, so the target
+ *                        is N / 100 from the next park -> wake on.
